WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.193
Brookfield and MAID: the financial convergence.

00:00:03.193 --> 00:00:08.818
Prime Minister Mark Carney holds six point eight million dollars in Brookfield Asset Management options.

00:00:08.818 --> 00:00:14.852
Brookfield manages over ten trillion dollars in assets including seniors housing and healthcare infrastructure.

00:00:14.852 --> 00:00:20.659
MAID reduces long-term care demand by twenty thousand, six hundred and eighty-five dollars per death.

00:00:20.659 --> 00:00:27.647
The financial convergence between the PM's personal holdings and government euthanasia policy is documented in the government's own numbers.

00:00:27.647 --> 00:00:30.522
Brookfield's healthcare and infrastructure holdings.

00:00:30.522 --> 00:00:35.318
Brookfield Asset Management is one of the world's largest alternative asset managers.

00:00:35.318 --> 00:00:41.374
Their portfolio includes seniors housing, long-term care facilities, and healthcare infrastructure across Canada.

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:49.238
Every MAID death reduces demand for these exact services — the same services owned by the company in which the Prime Minister holds millions in options.

00:00:49.238 --> 00:00:50.999
Financial convergence chain.

00:00:50.999 --> 00:00:57.170
The Prime Minister served as Brookfield's Chair of the Board and Head of Transition Investing before entering politics.

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:00.999
His six point eight million in options remain in a non-blind trust.

00:01:00.999 --> 00:01:13.670
The policy pathway is direct: MAID expansion reduces palliative care demand, which reduces long-term care occupancy, which benefits Brookfield's infrastructure portfolio, which benefits the PM's personal financial position.

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:15.136
Quantified impact.

00:01:15.136 --> 00:01:23.636
Seventy-six thousand, four hundred and seventy-five cumulative MAID deaths represent one point five eight billion dollars in avoided palliative care costs.

00:01:23.636 --> 00:01:30.749
The Parliamentary Budget Officer projected one point two seven three trillion dollars in cumulative savings by twenty forty-seven.

00:01:30.749 --> 00:01:35.579
One hundred and two top MAID physicians have been paid approximately eighteen million dollars.

00:01:35.579 --> 00:01:42.147
The government saves twenty thousand, six hundred and eighty-five dollars every time someone dies instead of receiving care.
